---
/**
 * /sms-marketing — Marketing & Loyalty SMS program disclosure.
 *
 * Companion to /sms (which documents the transactional/event-inquiry
 * program). This page documents the opt-in marketing SMS program that
 * sends promotional offers, event announcements, loyalty perks, and
 * birthday/anniversary rewards to subscribers who have explicitly
 * opted in.
 *
 * Created 2026-05-23 to support the second SignalWire/TCR campaign
 * registration. Mirrors /sms.astro structure section-for-section so
 * carriers and TCR reviewers can cross-check both programs against a
 * consistent disclosure pattern.
 *
 * Opt-in paths covered:
 *   (a) Web signup forms (/signup/* with explicit consent checkbox)
 *   (b) SMS keyword (texting BOWL, KIDS, or similar to our marketing
 *       number) — single-step double-opt-in via confirmation reply
 *   (c) In-venue kiosk enrollment
 *   (d) Patch-migrated subscriber list (customers who previously opted
 *       in via the legacy Patch Retention platform; consent records
 *       preserved through the migration)
 *
 * Cross-references:
 *   - /privacy Section 3 covers both this program and /sms from the
 *     privacy-policy angle; should stay consistent.
 *   - /terms covers both programs from the terms-of-service angle.
 *   - /sms documents the parallel transactional program.
 */
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SnapFooter from "../components/snap/SnapFooter.astro";
import BreadcrumbSchema from "../components/BreadcrumbSchema.astro";

const LAST_UPDATED = "May 23, 2026";
---
<Base
  title="Marketing SMS Program | Twisted Pin"
  description="How Twisted Pin's opt-in marketing SMS program works — promotional offers, event announcements, loyalty rewards. Easy opt-out anytime. Plainfield, IL."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="t2-hero" data-hero aria-labelledby="smsm-h1">
    <div class="t2-hero-copy">
      <p class="t-eyebrow hero-fade" data-delay-ms="0">Twisted Pin</p>
      <h1 class="t-display t2-hero-headline hero-fade" id="smsm-h1" data-delay-ms="120">
        Marketing SMS Program.
      </h1>
      <p class="t2-hero-sub hero-fade" data-delay-ms="320">
        Last updated {LAST_UPDATED}. How our opt-in marketing text program
        works, what we send, and how to opt out at any time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="t2-section legal-section" aria-labelledby="smsm-h2-1">
    <div class="t2-section-inner">
      <p class="legal-preamble">
        Twisted Pin ("Twisted Pin," "we," "us," "our") is a brand operated
        by Dow Holdings Inc, an Illinois corporation. This page documents
        our opt-in marketing and loyalty SMS program — the messages we
        send to customers who have explicitly subscribed to receive
        promotional offers, event announcements, and loyalty rewards.
        For our separate transactional SMS program (information requested
        during phone calls and event inquiries), see <a href="/sms/">SMS Information Service</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-1">1. Program description</h2>
      <p>
        The Twisted Pin Marketing SMS Program delivers periodic
        promotional text messages to customers who have opted in.
        Messages may include:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Promotional offers and discounts</li>
        <li>Event announcements (holidays, themed nights, special programming)</li>
        <li>Loyalty program notifications, including Insider tier perks</li>
        <li>Birthday and anniversary rewards</li>
        <li>Seasonal campaigns and venue news</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-2">2. How to opt in</h2>
      <p>
        You may opt in to the marketing SMS program in any of the
        following ways:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>(a) Website signup form.</strong> By submitting your
        phone number through a signup form at twistedpin.com (such as
        twistedpin.com/signup) and checking the consent checkbox, you
        expressly consent to receive recurring promotional text messages
        from Twisted Pin. The consent language displayed on the form
        reads, in substance:
      </p>
      <blockquote class="legal-blockquote">
        By providing your phone number and checking this box, you agree
        to receive recurring automated promotional text messages from
        Twisted Pin at the number provided. Consent is not a condition
        of purchase. Msg &amp; data rates may apply. Msg frequency varies.
        Reply HELP for help, STOP to cancel.
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        <strong>(b) SMS keyword opt-in.</strong> By texting an opt-in
        keyword (such as <strong>BOWL</strong> or <strong>KIDS</strong>)
        to our marketing number, you consent to receive recurring
        promotional text messages from Twisted Pin. We send a confirmation
        message restating the program terms after a keyword opt-in.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>(c) In-venue enrollment.</strong> By signing up at our
        in-venue kiosk and providing explicit consent, you opt in to the
        program. Consent is captured with timestamp and source.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>(d) Existing subscribers.</strong> Customers who
        previously opted in to Twisted Pin SMS marketing through our
        prior SMS provider remain subscribed under these terms. Consent
        records from that platform are preserved. Anyone wishing to opt
        out can do so at any time per Section 5 below.
      </p>

      <p>
        In all cases, you confirm that you are the account holder of the
        mobile number provided, or have the account holder's permission
        to enroll.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-3">3. Message frequency</h2>
      <p>
        Message frequency varies based on the season and campaigns we
        are running, but typically does not exceed <strong>eight (8)
        messages per month</strong>. Active subscribers may receive
        fewer; during quieter months you may receive one or none. We do
        not exceed eight per month under normal operations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-4">4. Message and data rates</h2>
      <p>
        Standard message and data rates may apply, depending on your
        mobile carrier. These charges are billed by your carrier, not
        by Twisted Pin.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-5">5. Help and opt-out</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message for assistance.</li>
        <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to opt out at any time. Other accepted opt-out keywords: STOPALL, UNSUBSCRIBE, CANCEL, END, QUIT.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Opt-out requests are honored immediately. After opting out, you
        will receive one final confirmation message and no further
        marketing messages will be sent to your number. To re-enroll
        after opting out, submit a new signup form, text an opt-in
        keyword, or enroll at our in-venue kiosk.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-6">6. Sample messages</h2>
      <p>
        For illustration, sample messages from this program may read:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>"Twisted Pin: Tomorrow's Tuesday night — $2 games + $1 shoes, 6-10pm. Walk in or reserve: [link]. Reply STOP to opt out."</li>
        <li>"Twisted Pin: Moms bowl FREE this Sunday at Twisted Pin. Bring the family, treat mom. Book here: [link]. Reply STOP to opt out."</li>
        <li>"Twisted Pin: Christopher, you've earned $10 off your next visit. Show this msg at the counter or redeem: [link]. Reply STOP to opt out."</li>
        <li>"Twisted Pin: NYE Bowling Bash is live — glow lanes, DJ, midnight champagne. Reserve before we sell out: [link]. Reply STOP to opt out."</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-7">7. Privacy and data sharing</h2>
      <p>
        Your phone number and personal information collected for this
        program are used solely to deliver the program and improve our
        marketing communications to you. No mobile information will be
        shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or
        promotional purposes. Information sharing with subcontractors
        that support delivery of the program (such as SMS delivery
        platforms and customer service vendors) is permitted solely to
        deliver the services you have requested. Text messaging
        originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any
        third parties.
      </p>
      <p>
        For full details, see our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-8">8. Related policies</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/terms/">SMS Terms and Conditions</a></li>
        <li><a href="/sms/">SMS Information Service</a> (transactional program)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-9">9. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        This SMS program is available to customers with a valid mobile
        phone number in the United States. By opting in, you represent
        that you are 18 years of age or older and are the account
        holder of the mobile number provided, or have authorization
        from the account holder to enroll.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-10">10. Changes to the program</h2>
      <p>
        Twisted Pin reserves the right to modify this program and
        these terms at any time. Material changes will be posted at
        twistedpin.com/sms-marketing/. Continued participation after
        changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated
        terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h2" id="smsm-h2-11">11. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about this SMS program or to verify your enrollment status:</p>
      <ul class="legal-contact">
        <li><strong>Business:</strong> Twisted Pin (operated by Dow Holdings Inc)</li>
        <li><strong>Address:</strong> 15610 Joliet Rd, Plainfield, IL 60544</li>
        <li><strong>Phone:</strong> 815-782-7790</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:contactus@twistedpin.com?subject=${encodeURIComponent("Marketing SMS Question")}&body=${encodeURIComponent("Hi,\n\n")}`}>contactus@twistedpin.com</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="legal-jurisdiction">
        Twisted Pin's marketing SMS program operates in compliance with
        TCPA regulations and CTIA messaging guidelines.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SnapFooter />
  <BreadcrumbSchema crumbs={[
    { name: "Home", path: "/" },
    { name: "Marketing SMS", path: "/sms-marketing/" },
  ]} />
</Base>

<style>
  /* Same legal-page recipe as /sms /privacy /terms /accessibility. */
  .legal-section .t2-section-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-preamble {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--warm-mid);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    background: rgba(244, 239, 227, 0.04);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--glow);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .legal-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 22px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin: 40px 0 14px;
  }
  .legal-h2:first-child { margin-top: 8px; }
  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .legal-h2 { font-size: 26px; margin-top: 48px; }
  }

  .legal-section p,
  .legal-section li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--warm-mid);
  }
  .legal-section p { margin: 0 0 14px; }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    padding-left: 22px;
  }
  .legal-section li { margin-bottom: 6px; }

  .legal-section strong { color: var(--warm-white); font-weight: 700; }

  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--glow);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .legal-blockquote {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    background: rgba(244, 239, 227, 0.05);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--glow);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .legal-contact {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .legal-jurisdiction {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(244, 239, 227, 0.10);
    font-size: 13px !important;
    color: var(--warm-dim) !important;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
